    <h2>Our commitment</h2>
    <p>3rd Set Smiles is committed to making this website accessible to as wide an audience as possible, including people with disabilities. We aim to conform to the <strong>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</strong>.</p>

    <h2>What we've done</h2>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>Semantic HTML structure with clear headings, landmarks, and link text.</li>
      <li>Sufficient color contrast between text and background.</li>
      <li>Keyboard-navigable navigation, with a skip-to-main-content link at the top of every page.</li>
      <li>Form fields paired with descriptive labels.</li>
      <li>Alt text on meaningful images (and explicit empty alt on decorative images).</li>
      <li>Respect for the user's <em>prefers-reduced-motion</em> setting.</li>
      <li>No content that flashes or auto-plays.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Known limitations</h2>
    <p>We're a small practice and we know there's always more to improve. If you encounter content that's difficult to use with assistive technology, we want to know.</p>

    <h2>Report an accessibility problem</h2>
    <p>If you have trouble using any part of this website &mdash; or need information presented in an alternative format &mdash; please contact us:</p>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>Phone: <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a></li>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
      <li>Mail: {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }} {{ site.address.postalCode }}</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We'll do our best to respond within 5 business days and to provide the information you need in the format that works best for you.</p>

    <h2>In-office accessibility</h2>
    <p>Our office is wheelchair accessible. If you have specific accommodations you'd like to request before your visit (interpreter, mobility assistance, written materials in larger print), please let us know when you book.</p>
